(6577068, 980377, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the sepia in this shot, I understand it''s probably edited that way because she''s old but I''m not sure it works. It''s made her eyeball look strangely brown which really spoils it for me. Lovely and sharp though.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the sepia in this shot, I understand it''s probably edited that way because she''s old but I''m not sure it works. It''s made her eyeball look strangely brown which really spoils it for me. Lovely and sharp though.', '2011-10-26 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577069, 980418, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cute expression.</td>', 'Cute expression.', '2011-10-26 16:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577070, 980489, 94265, '<td valign="top">The chances of two people being at the same spot at such an early hour and the shot not being posed seems a little slim to me. Nice idea though, I like the backlighting on her hair. Lens flare is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The chances of two people being at the same spot at such an early hour and the shot not being posed seems a little slim to me. Nice idea though, I like the backlighting on her hair. Lens flare is a bit distracting.', '2011-10-26 16:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
