(6577072, 980239, 94265, '<td valign="top">This genuinely looks candid, yay! I quite like the birds-eye view, I would''ve maybe cropped out a little more to get the top of the sign and the bottom of the chair in view.</td>', 'This genuinely looks candid, yay! I quite like the birds-eye view, I would''ve maybe cropped out a little more to get the top of the sign and the bottom of the chair in view.', '2011-10-26 16:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577073, 980214, 94265, '<td valign="top">Saturation on the pink is too strong. A bit odd but amusing nonetheless.</td>', 'Saturation on the pink is too strong. A bit odd but amusing nonetheless.', '2011-10-26 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577075, 979669, 94265, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to know what on earth he''s thinking. Nice bokeh, makes the toilet signs not too bothersome, if they were in bold focus too it would have killed the shot.</td>', 'Makes me want to know what on earth he''s thinking. Nice bokeh, makes the toilet signs not too bothersome, if they were in bold focus too it would have killed the shot.', '2011-10-26 16:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577076, 980040, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like how he''s singled out and how the faces of the crowd are almost entirely hard to make out; would''ve been too snappy with hoards of faces there. Works well with the title.</td>', 'I like how he''s singled out and how the faces of the crowd are almost entirely hard to make out; would''ve been too snappy with hoards of faces there. Works well with the title.', '2011-10-26 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577077, 980550, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too posed, like she turned and saw you and smiled for the camera; I''d have been inclined to snap as soon as she turned round and really catch a candid expression. Highlights are really blown on her forehead but it''s not too distracting.</td>', 'Looks a bit too posed, like she turned and saw you and smiled for the camera; I''d have been inclined to snap as soon as she turned round and really catch a candid expression. Highlights are really blown on her forehead but it''s not too distracting.', '2011-10-26 16:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
