(6577080, 980545, 94265, '<td valign="top">I imagine you''ll get a lot of stick for this one, although I suppose technically nearly every shot of a wild animal can be classed as candid! Good bokeh, pretty bird.</td>', 'I imagine you''ll get a lot of stick for this one, although I suppose technically nearly every shot of a wild animal can be classed as candid! Good bokeh, pretty bird.', '2011-10-26 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
