(6577083, 980169, 94265, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a slightly less tight crop (maybe even landscape) but otherwise it''s a nice sharp photo, good b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'I would have liked a slightly less tight crop (maybe even landscape) but otherwise it''s a nice sharp photo, good b&w conversion.', '2011-10-26 16:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
