(6577086, 980411, 94265, '<td valign="top">A nice shot and very sharp on the cops ''n'' horses, although there''s some halo-ing around them, not sure what you did processing-wise, I''d guess you maybe burned the background to bring more focus away from the cars? It''s not majorly distracting but very noticeable around the head and shoulders of the men.</td>', 'A nice shot and very sharp on the cops ''n'' horses, although there''s some halo-ing around them, not sure what you did processing-wise, I''d guess you maybe burned the background to bring more focus away from the cars? It''s not majorly distracting but very noticeable around the head and shoulders of the men.', '2011-10-26 16:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577087, 980110, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very cute moment, the horse looks in bliss! I''d have perhaps preferred it in black and white as the colours of the ropes in the background grab my eye. Still nice though.</td>', 'Very cute moment, the horse looks in bliss! I''d have perhaps preferred it in black and white as the colours of the ropes in the background grab my eye. Still nice though.', '2011-10-26 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577089, 980432, 94265, '<td valign="top">This image and title appears to me that your idea was that she is homeless and he is ignoring her but it doesn''t work for me as she''s clearly not begging. She has a nametag badge on her hip, is sitting on a neat stool and not the ground, her cup has a lid and clearly isn''t being used for accepting money; it appears like she''s just on a break from work or something. A good idea generally but a bit flawed; the b&amp;w was a wise idea.</td>', 'This image and title appears to me that your idea was that she is homeless and he is ignoring her but it doesn''t work for me as she''s clearly not begging. She has a nametag badge on her hip, is sitting on a neat stool and not the ground, her cup has a lid and clearly isn''t being used for accepting money; it appears like she''s just on a break from work or something. A good idea generally but a bit flawed; the b&w was a wise idea.', '2011-10-26 16:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577090, 980415, 94265, '<td valign="top">That pencil is really distracting, I can''t pinpoint what''s up with it but it looks different to the rest of the image. Sort of more vibrant. A good candid pic all the same, even though personally I hate smoking shots (personal preference alone.)</td>', 'That pencil is really distracting, I can''t pinpoint what''s up with it but it looks different to the rest of the image. Sort of more vibrant. A good candid pic all the same, even though personally I hate smoking shots (personal preference alone.)', '2011-10-26 16:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577092, 979949, 96664, '<td valign="top">I want to say this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jagar</a> but I may be wrong. Either way I have this one being the top photo. Well done.</td>', 'I want to say this is  Jagar but I may be wrong. Either way I have this one being the top photo. Well done.', '2011-10-26 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577106, 980417, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the title as it implies she''s showing them off for the camera, making it appear not candid. If that''s what she''s doing, it definitely doesn''t fit the challenge. I can also imagine though that she''s stopped for a moment to admire her shoes without thinking about who might be watching. Very cute.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the title as it implies she''s showing them off for the camera, making it appear not candid. If that''s what she''s doing, it definitely doesn''t fit the challenge. I can also imagine though that she''s stopped for a moment to admire her shoes without thinking about who might be watching. Very cute.', '2011-10-26 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577111, 980050, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject, it''s a good clash there of her outfit being nicely put together and the flower tied to her cart, all warm colours, then the plastic feeding tube in a cold contrast. Cool shot.</td>', 'This is a good subject, it''s a good clash there of her outfit being nicely put together and the flower tied to her cart, all warm colours, then the plastic feeding tube in a cold contrast. Cool shot.', '2011-10-26 16:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
