(6577186, 980408, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful technique and composition, but to me this really isn''t a candid.  IMNSHO, to be a real candid, we need to see the subject''s face and feel some involvement with him/her.</td>', 'Beautiful technique and composition, but to me this really isn''t a candid.  IMNSHO, to be a real candid, we need to see the subject''s face and feel some involvement with him/her.', '2011-10-26 18:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
