(6577188, 980587, 35545, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper and do with some cropping.  We really don''t need the Laurel Canyon sign and the AT&amp;T sign.  Concentrate on the man and his cool moustache.</td>', 'Could be sharper and do with some cropping.  We really don''t need the Laurel Canyon sign and the AT&T sign.  Concentrate on the man and his cool moustache.', '2011-10-26 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577189, 980584, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure why the crop is so vast, I''m not quite sure where to look in this picture even though the focus seems meant to be on the crouching woman; my eye wants to travel away up the building and is also grabbed an awful lot by the light on the stone and between the buildings. I also don''t understand the title at all, at least the wolf part of it. I''d like this more if it was closer on the woman, she looks busy in her own thoughts playing with her hair and would make a more interesting solo subject for me.</td>', 'Not sure why the crop is so vast, I''m not quite sure where to look in this picture even though the focus seems meant to be on the crouching woman; my eye wants to travel away up the building and is also grabbed an awful lot by the light on the stone and between the buildings. I also don''t understand the title at all, at least the wolf part of it. I''d like this more if it was closer on the woman, she looks busy in her own thoughts playing with her hair and would make a more interesting solo subject for me.', '2011-10-26 18:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577190, 980425, 35545, '<td valign="top">Cool capture, especially with the smoker on the right.  The letter box border is distracting.</td>', 'Cool capture, especially with the smoker on the right.  The letter box border is distracting.', '2011-10-26 18:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
