(6577258, 979773, 94265, '<td valign="top">He looks pretty cheesed off! I like this, nice focus on an interesting character.</td>', 'He looks pretty cheesed off! I like this, nice focus on an interesting character.', '2011-10-26 21:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577259, 980194, 94265, '<td valign="top">This lacks a defineable point of interest for me, it makes me think I''d rather see what the campsite people are up to.</td>', 'This lacks a defineable point of interest for me, it makes me think I''d rather see what the campsite people are up to.', '2011-10-26 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577260, 980485, 94265, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit deliberate and posed but a cute moment anyway, good complimentary colours.</td>', 'Looks a bit deliberate and posed but a cute moment anyway, good complimentary colours.', '2011-10-26 21:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577261, 979868, 94265, '<td valign="top">I feel like this either needs a big colour boost to enhance the sky and sand, or to be made totally b&amp;w as there''s a dull wishy-washiness to the colour as it is. A cool shot though, lovely moment, even from afar.</td>', 'I feel like this either needs a big colour boost to enhance the sky and sand, or to be made totally b&w as there''s a dull wishy-washiness to the colour as it is. A cool shot though, lovely moment, even from afar.', '2011-10-26 21:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577262, 980504, 94265, '<td valign="top">Día de los Muertos themed, funky. Like the colours. Wish it were a tad sharper on the leading lady though.</td>', 'Día de los Muertos themed, funky. Like the colours. Wish it were a tad sharper on the leading lady though.', '2011-10-26 21:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577263, 980380, 94265, '<td valign="top">If this is genuinely candid and not set-up, it''s a poignant moment and a very sweet idea. Greens are a tad strong for me, I''d have lowered the saturation a tad.</td>', 'If this is genuinely candid and not set-up, it''s a poignant moment and a very sweet idea. Greens are a tad strong for me, I''d have lowered the saturation a tad.', '2011-10-26 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577265, 980563, 94265, '<td valign="top">The contrast is a bit too dark for my liking as too much detail is lost from the beach and the girls. Pretty cool overall though.</td>', 'The contrast is a bit too dark for my liking as too much detail is lost from the beach and the girls. Pretty cool overall though.', '2011-10-26 21:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577267, 979981, 94265, '<td valign="top">This made me smile.</td>', 'This made me smile.', '2011-10-26 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577268, 979796, 87318, '<td valign="top">Could be an interesting shot, but seems to be missing something.  The equipment in the foreground seems to take center stage (both literally and figuratively) but it''s obvious from the title we should be looking at the aircraft arresting cable, which is almost imperceptible.  Also IMHO, the image might also benefit from a lower point of view.</td>', 'Could be an interesting shot, but seems to be missing something.  The equipment in the foreground seems to take center stage (both literally and figuratively) but it''s obvious from the title we should be looking at the aircraft arresting cable, which is almost imperceptible.  Also IMHO, the image might also benefit from a lower point of view.', '2011-10-26 21:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6577270, 980072, 94265, '<td valign="top">He''s smiling for the camera, not really a candid shot even though it''s a very nice one.</td>', 'He''s smiling for the camera, not really a candid shot even though it''s a very nice one.', '2011-10-26 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
