(6578364, 980003, 94265, '<td valign="top">Quite like this actually, looks to be genuinely candid and it''s a good moment to capture, the collector looks really into what the seller is showing him. Not keen on those side borders, draws my attention to the fact that it''s such a square crop; would have rather it was cropped in a more even-ratio way, like a set landscape or portrait crop. Personal preference though, I just don''t care for square crops. A 6 anyway. :-)</td>', 'Quite like this actually, looks to be genuinely candid and it''s a good moment to capture, the collector looks really into what the seller is showing him. Not keen on those side borders, draws my attention to the fact that it''s such a square crop; would have rather it was cropped in a more even-ratio way, like a set landscape or portrait crop. Personal preference though, I just don''t care for square crops. A 6 anyway. :-)', '2011-10-28 11:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
