(6580190, 979669, 49018, '<td valign="top">I see a relationship between the opposing arrows, the male and female figures and the simmetrical position of the hands. Among many valid images, in my opinion this looks possibly as the most classical style candid/street photography image in the challenge. I don''t normally give more than 9, but for this one I feel like doing an exception. Excellent job.</td>', 'I see a relationship between the opposing arrows, the male and female figures and the simmetrical position of the hands. Among many valid images, in my opinion this looks possibly as the most classical style candid/street photography image in the challenge. I don''t normally give more than 9, but for this one I feel like doing an exception. Excellent job.', '2011-10-31 16:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
