(6581367, 980301, 94265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horses, especially the brown one. Sweet photo.</td>', 'Beautiful horses, especially the brown one. Sweet photo.', '2011-11-01 15:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581369, 980462, 94265, '<td valign="top">Interesting characters in this one.</td>', 'Interesting characters in this one.', '2011-11-01 15:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581371, 980497, 94265, '<td valign="top">The focus on the hut is sharper than on the people in the cart which is a shame; still, at least it doesn''t seem stagey.</td>', 'The focus on the hut is sharper than on the people in the cart which is a shame; still, at least it doesn''t seem stagey.', '2011-11-01 15:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581373, 980425, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get what''s going on here, lol. Very odd behaviour. It doesn''t really appeal to me personally but it''s amusing, a good exposure and nicely crisp.</td>', 'I don''t quite get what''s going on here, lol. Very odd behaviour. It doesn''t really appeal to me personally but it''s amusing, a good exposure and nicely crisp.', '2011-11-01 15:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581375, 980272, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot, good bokeh, although the white posts grab my eye a bit.</td>', 'Nice simple shot, good bokeh, although the white posts grab my eye a bit.', '2011-11-01 15:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581376, 980450, 94265, '<td valign="top">This made me smile, although I wish their feet hadn''t been cropped off, looks a bit odd, especially on the younger woman.</td>', 'This made me smile, although I wish their feet hadn''t been cropped off, looks a bit odd, especially on the younger woman.', '2011-11-01 15:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581378, 980305, 94265, '<td valign="top">I quite like this. The poster of the man grabs my eye first because of the good sharp focus on it, which is possibly not the desired point of focus (the girl) but good all the same. Reflects how obsessed today''s youth is with technology, lol.</td>', 'I quite like this. The poster of the man grabs my eye first because of the good sharp focus on it, which is possibly not the desired point of focus (the girl) but good all the same. Reflects how obsessed today''s youth is with technology, lol.', '2011-11-01 15:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581379, 980017, 94265, '<td valign="top">This looks like an amusing candid moment, where on earth is the suited man''s hand though??? Lol! Made me smile, good capture.</td>', 'This looks like an amusing candid moment, where on earth is the suited man''s hand though??? Lol! Made me smile, good capture.', '2011-11-01 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581380, 980375, 94265, '<td valign="top">Highlights are a bit blown on his jacket (probably because it''s fluorescent and sunny?) but I like this anyway, he looks bored and sort of melancholy, like you''ve snapped a genuine moment of just being fed up in this young street cleaner''s potentially tedious day. 7 from me.</td>', 'Highlights are a bit blown on his jacket (probably because it''s fluorescent and sunny?) but I like this anyway, he looks bored and sort of melancholy, like you''ve snapped a genuine moment of just being fed up in this young street cleaner''s potentially tedious day. 7 from me.', '2011-11-01 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581381, 980482, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice progressive bokeh here, the subject isn''t too interesting for me personally but a well taken photo regardless. Good exposure in the sunlight as well.</td>', 'Nice progressive bokeh here, the subject isn''t too interesting for me personally but a well taken photo regardless. Good exposure in the sunlight as well.', '2011-11-01 15:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581383, 980241, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting on his face and beard.</td>', 'I like the backlighting on his face and beard.', '2011-11-01 15:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581385, 980409, 94265, '<td valign="top">His choice of t-shirt that matches the game they''re playing makes me think either this is set up or he is far too devoted to chess, lol. Nice shot though, just wish the smoke wasn''t there in his face, it barely obstructs but enough to bug me.</td>', 'His choice of t-shirt that matches the game they''re playing makes me think either this is set up or he is far too devoted to chess, lol. Nice shot though, just wish the smoke wasn''t there in his face, it barely obstructs but enough to bug me.', '2011-11-01 15:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581387, 979675, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think a wider crop might''ve been a good idea, the subject feels totally cramped. You''ve left a bit of a halo around the kid too, I''m assuming you were burning the background and didn''t take the tool close enough to the outline of the child. Don''t think it needed that since the background is too small an area and uninteresting to detract from your main subject. It''s a cute moment though, a 5 from me.</td>', 'I think a wider crop might''ve been a good idea, the subject feels totally cramped. You''ve left a bit of a halo around the kid too, I''m assuming you were burning the background and didn''t take the tool close enough to the outline of the child. Don''t think it needed that since the background is too small an area and uninteresting to detract from your main subject. It''s a cute moment though, a 5 from me.', '2011-11-01 15:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581388, 980494, 94265, '<td valign="top">He reminds me of Robert De Niro, only slimmer in the face, lol. I wish this was a teeny bit more landscape so as not to have cropped the end of his crutches off but I quite like the shot, he looks thoughtful. Exposure on the dog is a bit bright but I can see it was a really sunny day.</td>', 'He reminds me of Robert De Niro, only slimmer in the face, lol. I wish this was a teeny bit more landscape so as not to have cropped the end of his crutches off but I quite like the shot, he looks thoughtful. Exposure on the dog is a bit bright but I can see it was a really sunny day.', '2011-11-01 15:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581390, 980333, 94265, '<td valign="top">Sweet moment, nice bokeh. Would''ve maybe actually prefered it in colour as children are so vibrant when they play, colour might have helped emphasise that. Still a nice conversion though, I like th shot.</td>', 'Sweet moment, nice bokeh. Would''ve maybe actually prefered it in colour as children are so vibrant when they play, colour might have helped emphasise that. Still a nice conversion though, I like th shot.', '2011-11-01 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581410, 980380, 117717, '<td valign="top">You captured a very poignant moment.</td>', 'You captured a very poignant moment.', '2011-11-01 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581471, 979879, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the duck, and the little white tags, thats what makes the shot. excellent.</td>', 'I like the duck, and the little white tags, thats what makes the shot. excellent.', '2011-11-01 17:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581477, 980450, 101702, '<td valign="top">"Capture an interesting candid moment this week". I think you have done that perfectly. Shame about the cropped feet, and I feel a slight tilt when I look at the image like it is slightly off balance. Nice processing.</td>', '"Capture an interesting candid moment this week". I think you have done that perfectly. Shame about the cropped feet, and I feel a slight tilt when I look at the image like it is slightly off balance. Nice processing.', '2011-11-01 17:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
