(6581635, 980345, 54645, '<td valign="top">A lot of life in this image. Good work.</td>', 'A lot of life in this image. Good work.', '2011-11-01 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581639, 979969, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! His saunter is splendid.</td>', 'Ha! His saunter is splendid.', '2011-11-01 18:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581642, 979537, 54645, '<td valign="top">The faces are fatigued. I get the sense that they have been at this for some time. Excellent presentation as well.</td>', 'The faces are fatigued. I get the sense that they have been at this for some time. Excellent presentation as well.', '2011-11-01 18:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581644, 979949, 54645, '<td valign="top">There is a strong tension in their disconnection. Well done.</td>', 'There is a strong tension in their disconnection. Well done.', '2011-11-01 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581646, 980380, 54645, '<td valign="top">A lovely image and sentimet, although it seems a bit forced. Well done.</td>', 'A lovely image and sentimet, although it seems a bit forced. Well done.', '2011-11-01 18:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581652, 980415, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great timing.</td>', 'Great timing.', '2011-11-01 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581653, 979675, 54645, '<td valign="top">Masking needs work, but still a cute moment.</td>', 'Masking needs work, but still a cute moment.', '2011-11-01 19:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581767, 979949, 49018, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and good black and white. Possibly a bit of grain would have gone well with the otherwise classic feeling to the shot, so to smooth the transition between the foreground subjects and the background, but that''s probably just my taste.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and good black and white. Possibly a bit of grain would have gone well with the otherwise classic feeling to the shot, so to smooth the transition between the foreground subjects and the background, but that''s probably just my taste.', '2011-11-01 20:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581768, 980544, 49018, '<td valign="top">Love this one. It has a very interesting framing and angle, and reminds me of classic photography, the sixties and a defined photographic style. I think that perhaps a softer background and less blown highlights (on the right hand) might have improved the image, but honestly the photo is good enough to make this less then relevant. Excellent work, congratulations.</td>', 'Love this one. It has a very interesting framing and angle, and reminds me of classic photography, the sixties and a defined photographic style. I think that perhaps a softer background and less blown highlights (on the right hand) might have improved the image, but honestly the photo is good enough to make this less then relevant. Excellent work, congratulations.', '2011-11-01 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581769, 980231, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the soft feeling, the DOF and the general tone of the image.</td>', 'I like the soft feeling, the DOF and the general tone of the image.', '2011-11-01 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581770, 980072, 49018, '<td valign="top">I would not call it a candid, but I really love framing, simplicity of the picture and B&amp;W treatment. Very well done, excellent photo.</td>', 'I would not call it a candid, but I really love framing, simplicity of the picture and B&W treatment. Very well done, excellent photo.', '2011-11-01 20:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581772, 979969, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very Donnie Darko, I like the B&amp;W and the expression on the old man'' face. I am uncertain whether brightening up slightly the background would have improved separation of this from the subjects.</td>', 'Very Donnie Darko, I like the B&W and the expression on the old man'' face. I am uncertain whether brightening up slightly the background would have improved separation of this from the subjects.', '2011-11-01 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581773, 980549, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very expressive, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very expressive, I like it a lot.', '2011-11-01 20:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581774, 980160, 49018, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections and the tone, not sure if it falls into what I would call a candid, but excellent image notheless. I am sure the bride and groom loved this :)</td>', 'I love the reflections and the tone, not sure if it falls into what I would call a candid, but excellent image notheless. I am sure the bride and groom loved this :)', '2011-11-01 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581775, 980495, 49018, '<td valign="top">Excellent :) I just spotted the the "Meat is murder" writing on the wall. Was it a bit more evident, I think it would add a further (maybe a bit incoherent) layer of meaning to the photo :)</td>', 'Excellent :) I just spotted the the "Meat is murder" writing on the wall. Was it a bit more evident, I think it would add a further (maybe a bit incoherent) layer of meaning to the photo :)', '2011-11-01 20:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581776, 979652, 49018, '<td valign="top">Love her expression, well captured.</td>', 'Love her expression, well captured.', '2011-11-01 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581777, 980563, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the pose of the three girl. It almost look like a multiple exposure of a single girl turning and then walking off the rock. I wonder if it might have worked better underexposing to retain more detail in the sky while making the three girls into silhouettes.</td>', 'I like the pose of the three girl. It almost look like a multiple exposure of a single girl turning and then walking off the rock. I wonder if it might have worked better underexposing to retain more detail in the sky while making the three girls into silhouettes.', '2011-11-01 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581778, 980241, 49018, '<td valign="top">Love the rim light and the way the beard is exposed.</td>', 'Love the rim light and the way the beard is exposed.', '2011-11-01 20:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581780, 980301, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very tender, it seems to say a lot about the personality of the child.</td>', 'Very tender, it seems to say a lot about the personality of the child.', '2011-11-01 20:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581783, 980050, 49018, '<td valign="top">Expressive, it seems to tell something about the personality of the subject.</td>', 'Expressive, it seems to tell something about the personality of the subject.', '2011-11-01 20:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581784, 980158, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, and a wonderful capture.</td>', 'Lovely light, and a wonderful capture.', '2011-11-01 20:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581787, 980110, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice moment and interesting perspective due to the angle and the fences. I wonder if a tighter crop might work well as well.</td>', 'Nice moment and interesting perspective due to the angle and the fences. I wonder if a tighter crop might work well as well.', '2011-11-01 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581792, 980184, 49018, '<td valign="top">Well composed and timed, I love how the eye travels from the masked face to the half amused expression of the girl and then to the definetely amused observer in the background. I also like how her hand seem to to struggle briefly to decide whether to shake hands or stay in the pocket. It says something about the situation.</td>', 'Well composed and timed, I love how the eye travels from the masked face to the half amused expression of the girl and then to the definetely amused observer in the background. I also like how her hand seem to to struggle briefly to decide whether to shake hands or stay in the pocket. It says something about the situation.', '2011-11-01 21:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581800, 980561, 94265, '<td valign="top">Quite sweet, looks like a very warm family moment. :-)</td>', 'Quite sweet, looks like a very warm family moment. :-)', '2011-11-01 21:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581803, 980432, 49018, '<td valign="top">Always a very good concept but also, if the girls is a beggar as she seems, a very common view. If the idea was to convey the attempt of the passer by to ignore the beggar, maybe capturing a more extreme attitude, such a turning of the face, would have made for a stronger image.</td>', 'Always a very good concept but also, if the girls is a beggar as she seems, a very common view. If the idea was to convey the attempt of the passer by to ignore the beggar, maybe capturing a more extreme attitude, such a turning of the face, would have made for a stronger image.', '2011-11-01 21:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581805, 980550, 49018, '<td valign="top">Obviously not a candid, but a really good portrait and image anyway.</td>', 'Obviously not a candid, but a really good portrait and image anyway.', '2011-11-01 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581806, 980371, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, I like the muted tones.</td>', 'Nice portrait, I like the muted tones.', '2011-11-01 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581810, 980553, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very expressive and funny. I find the eyes a bit too present, contrst-wise, which distracts me a bit form the rest of the scene, but probably it''s just my taste. Well captured.</td>', 'Very expressive and funny. I find the eyes a bit too present, contrst-wise, which distracts me a bit form the rest of the scene, but probably it''s just my taste. Well captured.', '2011-11-01 21:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581811, 980158, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the slightly muted tones a lot, very national geographic old style.</td>', 'I like the slightly muted tones a lot, very national geographic old style.', '2011-11-01 21:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581817, 980505, 49018, '<td valign="top">A pretty difficult light to cope with, I think. I like the pose, the detail in the shadow and the rim of light around the face. More detail in the highlights would have been great but the range is pretty extreme. Was this taken in raw?<br/>Good job.</td>', 'A pretty difficult light to cope with, I think. I like the pose, the detail in the shadow and the rim of light around the face. More detail in the highlights would have been great but the range is pretty extreme. Was this taken in raw?Good job.', '2011-11-01 21:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581818, 980415, 49018, '<td valign="top">I find it a bit overprocessed and too saturated, but that''s just my taste. Great timing and subject.</td>', 'I find it a bit overprocessed and too saturated, but that''s just my taste. Great timing and subject.', '2011-11-01 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581819, 980450, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice simmetry, well spotted :)</td>', 'Nice simmetry, well spotted :)', '2011-11-01 21:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581820, 980504, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the expressions, good timing and framing. However, I am not too fond of the postprocessing, I find the artefacts in the background and the color cast a bit too strong.</td>', 'I like the expressions, good timing and framing. However, I am not too fond of the postprocessing, I find the artefacts in the background and the color cast a bit too strong.', '2011-11-01 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581822, 979676, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like it but I find the sharpening a bit too aggressive and grungy for this kind of subject.</td>', 'I like it but I find the sharpening a bit too aggressive and grungy for this kind of subject.', '2011-11-01 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581823, 980474, 49018, '<td valign="top">Funny and interesting, but perhaps more a portrait than a candid.</td>', 'Funny and interesting, but perhaps more a portrait than a candid.', '2011-11-01 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581825, 980157, 49018, '<td valign="top">Flowers for the barber? I like the subject but I am not sure whether the car and the glimpse of the neighbourhood add or detract from the shot. I wonder if cropping/framing so to only include the guy and the barber shop might have worked better.</td>', 'Flowers for the barber? I like the subject but I am not sure whether the car and the glimpse of the neighbourhood add or detract from the shot. I wonder if cropping/framing so to only include the guy and the barber shop might have worked better.', '2011-11-01 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581826, 980417, 49018, '<td valign="top">Cute pose and I like the DOF. Possibly more contrast or simply a brightening up the highlights in the background would have improved the image.</td>', 'Cute pose and I like the DOF. Possibly more contrast or simply a brightening up the highlights in the background would have improved the image.', '2011-11-01 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581827, 980569, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the framing, even if it looks a bit midway between showing the feet or cropping higher. I think the blank sky spoils it a bit, but I guess that if there was no detail in the sky to start with, it coudn''t be fixed by underexposing or using a polarizer. Perhaps setting a darker tone for the leaves while converting to B&amp;W would have helped?</td>', 'I like the framing, even if it looks a bit midway between showing the feet or cropping higher. I think the blank sky spoils it a bit, but I guess that if there was no detail in the sky to start with, it coudn''t be fixed by underexposing or using a polarizer. Perhaps setting a darker tone for the leaves while converting to B&W would have helped?', '2011-11-01 21:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581830, 980108, 49018, '<td valign="top">If the idea is to delay the moment the viewer will find the child and therefore the actual point of interest in the photograph, I like it. However, I find this works particularly well when the photograph has some kind of obvious, apparent subject, so that the viewer can relax, just to then suddendly realize that there is another less obvious point of interest and possibly the real subject of the image.<br/>So, perhaps another angle showing maybe more of the faces of the crowd, or the event they are watching if there is an event, and then somewhere the peering face of the child, would have worked better for me.</td>', 'If the idea is to delay the moment the viewer will find the child and therefore the actual point of interest in the photograph, I like it. However, I find this works particularly well when the photograph has some kind of obvious, apparent subject, so that the viewer can relax, just to then suddendly realize that there is another less obvious point of interest and possibly the real subject of the image.So, perhaps another angle showing maybe more of the faces of the crowd, or the event they are watching if there is an event, and then somewhere the peering face of the child, would have worked better for me.', '2011-11-01 21:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581831, 980297, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing and texture. Did you tried black and white on this one? I am not sure if a straight desaturation would work, but playing around with the channels mixer could create quite a lot of interesting contrast.</td>', 'Interesting framing and texture. Did you tried black and white on this one? I am not sure if a straight desaturation would work, but playing around with the channels mixer could create quite a lot of interesting contrast.', '2011-11-01 21:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581832, 980323, 49018, '<td valign="top">Funny :) The rail behind the man''s head is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Funny :) The rail behind the man''s head is a bit distracting.', '2011-11-01 21:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581834, 980456, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and capture. I do take a flexible approach about the theme and in general I will rate a suggestive or impressive photo high, even if it doesnt''t quite fit the theme. However, in this case I really feel like saying ''this is not a candid'' :) Perhaps, aside of a direct portrait, a picture of a performer in action is just the anthytesis of a candid. I say this not as a criticism but to point out that there are is always a public side and an inner side to a performer on stage, and I have seen real candids taken at performances. An angry or worried glance because one of the other performers is out of time or because of some technical problem, a spontaneous smile between musicians which is obviosiously not intended for the audience. Backstage and end of concert moments. Perhaps, even at that specific event there were a few moments showing more of what the artist is and less of what he wants to show to the audience.</td>', 'Nice pose and capture. I do take a flexible approach about the theme and in general I will rate a suggestive or impressive photo high, even if it doesnt''t quite fit the theme. However, in this case I really feel like saying ''this is not a candid'' :) Perhaps, aside of a direct portrait, a picture of a performer in action is just the anthytesis of a candid. I say this not as a criticism but to point out that there are is always a public side and an inner side to a performer on stage, and I have seen real candids taken at performances. An angry or worried glance because one of the other performers is out of time or because of some technical problem, a spontaneous smile between musicians which is obviosiously not intended for the audience. Backstage and end of concert moments. Perhaps, even at that specific event there were a few moments showing more of what the artist is and less of what he wants to show to the audience.', '2011-11-01 21:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581835, 979809, 49018, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different white balance and a DOF which would keep both branches and cat in focus would have worked better. Cute shot and huge cat :)</td>', 'Maybe a different white balance and a DOF which would keep both branches and cat in focus would have worked better. Cute shot and huge cat :)', '2011-11-01 21:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581836, 980514, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression. The postprocessing is mperhaps a bit too contrasty.</td>', 'Interesting expression. The postprocessing is mperhaps a bit too contrasty.', '2011-11-01 21:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
