(6582293, 980381, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by surfer57:</b></div><hr/><i> the subject is awesome, the challenge was candid. The shot is very staged , not so candid. Nice shot for portraiture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The shot was not staged, sorry, no cigar</td>', 'Originally posted by surfer57: the subject is awesome, the challenge was candid. The shot is very staged , not so candid. Nice shot for portraiture.   The shot was not staged, sorry, no cigar', '2011-11-02 04:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6582310, 980432, 136146, '<td valign="top">Some commenters wondered whether the woman was really homeless since she has a badge and a stool and a cup of tea in her hand. I hadn''t realized how this would detract from the impact of the image until it was pointed out...it all seemed self explanatory to me. Nevertheless I can totally understand the scepticism. Big issue selling is a sanitized form of begging where the sellers register to prove that they are bona fide and the passers by can hand over money in exchange for a magazine rather than directly to the homeless person. It is meant to preserve dignity on all sides. Not totally sure it always works. Thanks to all those who commented.</td>', 'Some commenters wondered whether the woman was really homeless since she has a badge and a stool and a cup of tea in her hand. I hadn''t realized how this would detract from the impact of the image until it was pointed out...it all seemed self explanatory to me. Nevertheless I can totally understand the scepticism. Big issue selling is a sanitized form of begging where the sellers register to prove that they are bona fide and the passers by can hand over money in exchange for a magazine rather than directly to the homeless person. It is meant to preserve dignity on all sides. Not totally sure it always works. Thanks to all those who commented.', '2011-11-02 04:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6582315, 980333, 131264, '<td valign="top">Congratulation, one of my favourites</td>', 'Congratulation, one of my favourites', '2011-11-02 04:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6582319, 980549, 131264, '<td valign="top">Great Artwork Neat, I like the style which freezes the Moment in a very special way. Thunbs Up!</td>', 'Great Artwork Neat, I like the style which freezes the Moment in a very special way. Thunbs Up!', '2011-11-02 05:05:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6582330, 980333, 114285, '<td valign="top">Just missed out, I was sure it would ribbon.</td>', 'Just missed out, I was sure it would ribbon.', '2011-11-02 05:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
