(6583010, 980584, 69324, '<td valign="top">Out of the box composition for a candid I feel, certainly not a crime in my book.  Great depth and processing, but the single biggest selling point for me was that you managed to catch the child in midair, nice work.</td>', 'Out of the box composition for a candid I feel, certainly not a crime in my book.  Great depth and processing, but the single biggest selling point for me was that you managed to catch the child in midair, nice work.', '2011-11-02 18:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
