(6583076, 980072, 68504, '<td valign="top">It''s a sweet shot, lovely light and composition, and I would say there is much candor in the subject''s smile. I would not like to pronounce one way or another on the photo''s candidity - the thought of it makes me grumpy and ruins my appreciation of this shining little light beam. Had I voted this would have been at my higher end.</td>', 'It''s a sweet shot, lovely light and composition, and I would say there is much candor in the subject''s smile. I would not like to pronounce one way or another on the photo''s candidity - the thought of it makes me grumpy and ruins my appreciation of this shining little light beam. Had I voted this would have been at my higher end.', '2011-11-02 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583102, 980072, 11854, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid Karma! I didn''t vote in this challenge because that thread was getting under my skin (though I try not to let it happen, sometimes it still does). At least you did fairly well despite the comments. I didn''t fair nearly so well. ;D</td>', 'Lovely candid Karma! I didn''t vote in this challenge because that thread was getting under my skin (though I try not to let it happen, sometimes it still does). At least you did fairly well despite the comments. I didn''t fair nearly so well. ;D', '2011-11-02 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
