(6583203, 980549, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  I thought it was so fascinating.  Just to sit and watch and wonder.  Beautiful capture!</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  I thought it was so fascinating.  Just to sit and watch and wonder.  Beautiful capture!', '2011-11-02 20:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583204, 979949, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love your street shots.  It fascinates me how you can slip in and be a part of the scene and take photos while no one notices.  Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'I love your street shots.  It fascinates me how you can slip in and be a part of the scene and take photos while no one notices.  Congrats on the blue!', '2011-11-02 20:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
