(6583210, 980136, 67697, '<td valign="top">Life is good and so is this!  The looks on everyone''s face is priceless.  I can''t stop staring at that pink blotch on that one person''s head.   Congrats on finishing in the top 10!</td>', 'Life is good and so is this!  The looks on everyone''s face is priceless.  I can''t stop staring at that pink blotch on that one person''s head.   Congrats on finishing in the top 10!', '2011-11-02 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583213, 980381, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol how on earth could anyone tell whether or not this was staged?  Such a wonderful capture.  It''s a beautiful study in the characteristics of this man''s face.  Congrats on a good finish :)</td>', 'lol how on earth could anyone tell whether or not this was staged?  Such a wonderful capture.  It''s a beautiful study in the characteristics of this man''s face.  Congrats on a good finish :)', '2011-11-02 20:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583214, 980345, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh wow she does look like Marilyn.  I''m sure she would find that to be a great compliment.  Maybe she will get lucky and see this photo some day.</td>', 'Oh wow she does look like Marilyn.  I''m sure she would find that to be a great compliment.  Maybe she will get lucky and see this photo some day.', '2011-11-02 20:47:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583215, 979537, 67697, '<td valign="top">The background is interesting, and the photos the woman holds are quite compelling.  Good capture.</td>', 'The background is interesting, and the photos the woman holds are quite compelling.  Good capture.', '2011-11-02 20:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583216, 980552, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  I was pretty intrigued by this.  It would have been fun if the man''s head was tilted in the same direction as the ones in the portraits.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  I was pretty intrigued by this.  It would have been fun if the man''s head was tilted in the same direction as the ones in the portraits.', '2011-11-02 20:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583217, 980585, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really do like this.  It''s like you''ve captured an action moment for detective in a crime show.  He just looks smooth.  :D</td>', 'I really do like this.  It''s like you''ve captured an action moment for detective in a crime show.  He just looks smooth.  :D', '2011-11-02 20:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583218, 979760, 67697, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful.  I love seeing that little hand popping out of the sleeve, ready to help the other hand holding the fork.  He''s so adorable!</td>', 'I think this is wonderful.  I love seeing that little hand popping out of the sleeve, ready to help the other hand holding the fork.  He''s so adorable!', '2011-11-02 20:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583221, 979507, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s how I feel about a lot of photos I take.  Funny title :)</td>', 'That''s how I feel about a lot of photos I take.  Funny title :)', '2011-11-02 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583227, 980549, 14476, '<td valign="top">Looks as if people commented with their voting fingers.</td>', 'Looks as if people commented with their voting fingers.', '2011-11-02 21:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583228, 980072, 76335, '<td valign="top">He''s smiling at you, not the camera. Candid enough for me. It''s great.</td>', 'He''s smiling at you, not the camera. Candid enough for me. It''s great.', '2011-11-02 21:05:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583266, 980108, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so cute!  I love that little face.  Makes me miss how tiny mine used to be.  I''m also now fascinated by the woman''s foot in a brace.  I guess I''m easily amused :)</td>', 'Oh this is so cute!  I love that little face.  Makes me miss how tiny mine used to be.  I''m also now fascinated by the woman''s foot in a brace.  I guess I''m easily amused :)', '2011-11-02 21:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583269, 980231, 125275, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I do think the "missed" focus probably distracted some voters.<br/> <br/>Focus has a tendency to direct the eyes movements, and in this shot it causes the eye to move across the ear which is not really the subject of the picture. Still a nice candid, but I''d definitely think the focus is responsible for the finishing.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot. I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I do think the "missed" focus probably distracted some voters. Focus has a tendency to direct the eyes movements, and in this shot it causes the eye to move across the ear which is not really the subject of the picture. Still a nice candid, but I''d definitely think the focus is responsible for the finishing.', '2011-11-02 22:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6583324, 980549, 30982, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful, Anita, and completely deserving of all the kind words you''ve received.  Love the toning - is it a quadtone by chance?  Looks like one I used to use a bit.</td>', 'Truly beautiful, Anita, and completely deserving of all the kind words you''ve received.  Love the toning - is it a quadtone by chance?  Looks like one I used to use a bit.', '2011-11-02 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
