(6586886, 979717, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sfalice:</b></div><hr/><i> I do not know what krupuk is, but I loved your little old lady and one of the 10s you received was mine.<br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, Alice. Actually I did write something for critique and mentioning about the word "Krupuk", <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krupuk" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here</a>. If you visit the hemisphere here, just remember that delicious word, haha. This candid shot did have some mistake with distraction of chilies bottles. Anyway,I am very much appreciated for your support of 10s. Thanks again.</td>', 'Originally posted by sfalice: I do not know what krupuk is, but I loved your little old lady and one of the 10s you received was mine.:)   Thank you, Alice. Actually I did write something for critique and mentioning about the word "Krupuk", Here. If you visit the hemisphere here, just remember that delicious word, haha. This candid shot did have some mistake with distraction of chilies bottles. Anyway,I am very much appreciated for your support of 10s. Thanks again.', '2011-11-06 21:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
